  "review": {
    "kind": "author review",
    "findings": [
      "Array bounds require aligned input and checked packet lengths. Input and packet counts are bounded.",
      "The inspector rejects unsupported encrypted/compressed modes, orphan Type2 packets and missing CRC evidence. It does not classify them as hardware incompatibility.",
